{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: Gri'lek's run speed rises by 5% every 20 seconds",
  "contract": [
    "The testers of 2026-11-13 report that on live Gri'lek (15082) started slow and easy to kite, then grew faster",
    "for as long as the fight lasted, by the same amount as his damage, until he outran players even with their",
    "movement abilities. His damage rises by one hidden +5% stack 1 s into the fight and every 20 s after; each step",
    "now also adds one stack of a hidden run-speed aura (1002357, custom 5 per stack). Avatar (83068) keeps its -50%",
    "for the whole fight, so his speed is (1 + 0.05 x stacks) x 0.5 of his base. Two grouped heroes fight the Mythic",
    "Gri'lek: with one stack and with three the ratio of his run speed is 1.15 / 1.05 = 1.095; the old script, with",
    "no speed stacks, gave exactly 1.00."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8914.0,
    "y": -133.0,
    "z": 80.6
  },
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "lead",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "mate",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 60
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
